              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "kilrbuni"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have made this a few times. Use any canned beans you want. I left out the mushrooms and the extra sugar isn't necessary. It's delicious every time and super easy!!!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AmandaG"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used all fresh garden veggies, the extra sugar was needed! Then instead of garbanzo beans I used black beans. Instead of bell pepper I used sweet banana peppers (all colors). Instead of cider vinegar I used reg distilled vinegar. Instead of can corn, I used two cobs of corn boiled cut off the cob, all veggies except onion, peppers were cooked prior no mushrooms were added.",
            "datePublished": "2018-08-23T15:55:45.483Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "hogheaven"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I left out the corn and unfortunately I didn't have green beans, but otherwise I made the same recipe. I used my emulsion blender to mix the salad dressing. I agree with the posters; the flavor was bland. I added garlic powder. Boom! that's all it needed. It is now a tasty salad. I will add green beans tonight. Before we finish it off I will add a lesser amount of corn to see if I like the addition. Enjoy!",
            "datePublished": "2017-07-26T11:56:29.510Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kansas"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this recipe as directed, only not using the mushrooms. I have family members that do not like them. I gave this 3 stars because not only did I just think the flavor was so- so, the rest of my crew thought the same. Like the other reviews indicated, the extra sugar is not needed unless you prefer sweeter bean salads. It was worth a try though.",
            "datePublished": "2014-08-12T10:01:02.063Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Happyschmoopies"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This salad was very colorful and had a lot of texture. It was good, but, not great for us. I think it needed to have more dressing and for our taste needed a little more tang. I didn't add the additional 1/4 cup of sugar and it still seemed a little sweet for my family. If you like a sweeter salad - you would probably enjoy this recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2012-08-22T18:30:31.300Z"
          }
        ],
